@startuml
left to right direction
actor Customer
actor Operator
actor Admin
actor "IoT device / simulator" as Device

rectangle "FreshVend" as System {
  usecase "Browse available catalog" as UC1
  usecase "Create account / sign in" as UC2
  usecase "Create demo transaction" as UC3
  usecase "Simulate payment" as UC4
  usecase "Simulate dispense result" as UC5
  usecase "View receipt / jam result" as UC6
  usecase "View machine, stock and alerts" as UC7
  usecase "Restock / stocktake" as UC8
  usecase "View temperature history" as UC9
  usecase "Clear fault after safe telemetry" as UC10
  usecase "Manage machines, products and users" as UC11
  usecase "View analytics / export CSV" as UC12
  usecase "Send authenticated telemetry" as UC13
}

Customer --> UC1
Customer --> UC2
Customer --> UC3
Customer --> UC4
Customer --> UC5
Customer --> UC6
Operator --> UC7
Operator --> UC8
Operator --> UC9
Operator --> UC10
Admin --> UC7
Admin --> UC8
Admin --> UC9
Admin --> UC10
Admin --> UC11
Admin --> UC12
Device --> UC13
UC3 .> UC1 : validates machine / column / stock
UC5 .> UC4 : follows successful demo payment
UC10 .> UC13 : requires recent safe telemetry

note bottom of System
Payment and dispense are simulated in release 1.0.0.
No native Flutter / React Native app is included; the web app is installable as a PWA.
end note
@enduml
